    "author": "MURMUR Sound Design",
    "description": "Interstellar spatial pad #027 \u2014 Lagrange Point. Headphone-first spatial pad \u2014 M3 is algorithmic reverb; load companion QUASAR preset `027-lagrange-point.quasar` on the master bus for binaural spatial. Single held notes 8+ s; ORBIT and SPACE macros move the Quasar scene; slow LFO orbit is always on. Engines: Classic, Granular, Resonator.",
